<title>ITALY: Gross yield set at 7.74pct at Italy 30-yr Btp sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield set at 7.74pct at Italy 30-yr Btp sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a second tranche of 2.0 trillion lire worth of a 30-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bond (Btp) with a 7.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		     Nov 1, 2026	    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.77 pct		 6.48 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.74 pct		 7.42</p>
<p> Assigned price 95.90		    99.45</p>
<p> Bids	     2.168 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.000  trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with the previous auction on January 30 of the first tranche of the 30-year Btp.</p>
</text>
